{"summary":"Enter a world full of dress up items and discover different fashion styles","description":"Are you ready for some fun with fashion? Join our dolls in a fabulous dress up game and become their guide in the amazing world of fashion!\n\nThe dolls want to try new fashion styles and could use some expert advice. Enter one of the most stylish dress up games and be amazed by all the options available. The wardrobes are filled with dresses, cute blouses, pants, jackets, skirts and many accessories. Our dress up game includes 10 main styles such as casual, office, kawaii, punk, fairy, tomboy.\n\nExperiment with each fashion style and create amazing looks. Discover sweet kawaii clothes and pastel hairstyles, try a punk look with a black dress and daring accessories, or go for a special fairy look with wings and flower headbands.\n\nTrendy Fashion Styles Dress highlights:\n- 10 dress up levels with special themes\n- many dolls characters to play with\n- unique clothes in each game level\n- different makeup sets for all dolls\n- special section to store your favorite looks\n- free and easy to play game\n\nThere are no wrong choices in this game, so pick whatever you like. Find out what looks best on each girl and create as many looks as you want. Don't forget to save the best outfits.\n\nTrendy Fashion Styles is the perfect game for fashion and dress up lovers. Get ready to show your skills and create countless looks!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$1.49 - $6.49 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ah7dN-lYB5M?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2zFd5hzVD7Rr4oHOQtt3RoSgTcPFwm1BYugZgPylZtrrtc6TtBOTBHuDCPXg5LAgBcjYgRrtoEzFDmgCxajzIw","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/H_ZwjEesHiqZ1MmaQPlYpvOVYAEb2G1UkwDn5_HALaZn-JDrSuCloyuOTazTjqlthoRTnDCBSv80FpcnMr6c","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/T6EOh0UiUEyIKoh7s_oHWkIRo4uokXBmL9fzJKsnypB6KZL-Kx6SjlxSRElq3_yGZmfveII-j5-mPEBSCH